{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ie/reviews/id6213052"}, "name":{"label":"PFinn"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-08-02T02:05:52-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"2024.8"}, "id":{"label":"11562800172"}, "title":{"label":"One of the best podcast apps out there"}, "content":{"label":"I've been using the new version of the app (a complete rewrite of the app) extensively and it is, as ever, excellent from a podcast listening experience with features that make podcasts an actively better experience. \n\nThe new design of course requires an adjustment in behaviour, and there have been bugs and regressions in some features. That being said, the new foundation is clearly allowing the developer to rapidly address concerns (3 updates within the space of two weeks) and I have every confidence they will iron out these issues.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ie/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
