{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ie/reviews/id13118134"}, "name":{"label":"any_sh"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2022-04-03T09:12:23-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"2022.3"}, "id":{"label":"8527693496"}, "title":{"label":"The crème de la crème of podcast apps"}, "content":{"label":"I have been using this app for at least 6 years, and I’ve not found anything that comes even close to its capabilities from downloads, streaming, speed up, gap skipping and content tag detection.\nI’m clocking an insane throughput of podcasts, and this app has yet to balk at anything I’ve thrown at it.\nThe ability to extract your subscriptions also means that you’re not locked into it - you can move anywhere you want.\nI simply cannot recommend this app more highly and have been happily contributing to its ongoing development by the in-app purchase.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ie/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
